{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"capabilities is the negotiation channel for wire features a peer may not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"understand. A server sets it on the pack it returns to advertise what it"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"supports; a client must treat absence as “unsupported” rather than as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"“unknown”, because a server that predates a feature cannot say so.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"capabilities"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It exists because a server does not store the bytes a client sent: it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"re-encodes from its own domain model, so a field it does not know is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dropped from the stored change log and the push still succeeds. Without a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"handshake a client cannot tell that its restore was silently downgraded to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"an ordinary insert. Measured against a pinned v0.7.20 server."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:6Yorkie0A14_V1_ChangePackV12capabilitiesSaySSGvp","roleHeading":"Instance Property","title":"capabilities","modules":[{"name":"Yorkie"}],"symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"capabilities","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}